<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Request for Reimbursement</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .instruction { font-size: 0.9em; color: #555; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .warning { color: red; font-weight: bold; }
  .info-box { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .grid-2-col { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .grid-2-col > div { width: 48%; }
  .line-item-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  .line-item-table td { padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; }
  .line-item-table th { background-color: #f2f2f2; text-align: left; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">Request for Reimbursement</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt;">from your FSA for Health Care Expenses</p>
  </header>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">What is this form for?</h2>
    <p class="instruction">Use this Request for Reimbursement form to ask for payment from your FSA for eligible care you've already received.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="info-box">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Get your money back faster. Submit your expenses online.</h3>
        <p class="instruction">You can skip this form and easily submit your expenses online for faster reimbursement. Plus, it reduces errors and saves paper. Here's how:</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Log in to your member website.</li>
          <li>Follow steps to submit a claim form.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="info-box">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Why submit online?</h3>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Your form is instantly submitted for review.</li>
          <li>You may be able to sign up for email alerts to track payments.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">What expenses are eligible?</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>A general list of eligible expenses and frequently asked questions is available on your member website.</li>
      <li><span class="warning">Don't miss the deadline:</span> Your request must be postmarked <span data-field="deadline_timing">{{ deadline_timing }}</span> the submission deadline, which you can find in your benefits document. For help, contact your employer or plan sponsor.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0;">Before you begin</h3>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
      <img src="placeholder_signature.png" alt="Signature Placeholder" style="width: 150px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px;">
      <p class="instruction">Use only black or blue pen to fill out the form.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <p style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">&#9888;</p>
      <p class="instruction">Have you moved? Be sure to let your employer or plan sponsor know your new address so you will receive your payment.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Please continue to the form on the next page.</p>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="UnitedHealthcare Logo" style="height: 40px;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
    <div>
      <p>Need help?</p>
      <p>Call us at <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      Page 1 of 3
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Part 1: About you</h2>
  </header>

  <div class="info-box">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003; Required information, please complete this section.</p>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="full_name">Your name (Last, First, MI)</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 60%;">
        <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <label for="employer_name" style="margin-left: 30%;">Your employer</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 60%;">
        <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003; You can find these two numbers on your Health Plan ID Card or your member website.</p>
    <div class="grid-2-col">
      <div>
        <label for="member_id">Your UnitedHealthcare Member ID#</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 80%;">
          <span data-field="member_id">{{ member_id }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="group_number">Your Group Number</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 80%;">
          <span data-field="group_number">{{ group_number }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2-col">
      <div>
        <label for="dob">Your Date of Birth</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 80%;">
          <span data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="mailing_address">Your mailing address (street address, city, state, ZIP)</label>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 90%;">
      <span data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Part 2: About your expenses</h2>
  </header>

  {% for i in range(1, 4) %}
  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 15px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">&#10003; Expense {{ i }} - Information must match your receipt.</h3>

    <div class="grid-2-col">
      <div>
        <label>Start date of care or service</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 100%;">
          <span data-field="line_items[{{ i-1 }}].start_date">{{ line_items[i-1].start_date }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Patient name</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 100%;">
          <span data-field="line_items[{{ i-1 }}].patient_name">{{ line_items[i-1].patient_name }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2-col">
      <div>
        <label>End date (may be the same as start date)</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 100%;">
          <span data-field="line_items[{{ i-1 }}].end_date">{{ line_items[i-1].end_date }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>This is (check one):</label>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
          <label><input type="radio" name="relationship_{{ i }}" value="myself"> Myself</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="relationship_{{ i }}" value="spouse"> My spouse</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="relationship_{{ i }}" value="dependent"> My dependent</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2-col">
      <div>
        <label>Type of Expense (check one):</label>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
          <label><input type="radio" name="expense_type_{{ i }}" value="medical"> Medical</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="expense_type_{{ i }}" value="prescription"> Prescription (RX)</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="expense_type_{{ i }}" value="dental"> Dental</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="expense_type_{{ i }}" value="over_the_counter"> Over-the-Counter (OTC)</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="expense_type_{{ i }}" value="vision"> Vision</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="expense_type_{{ i }}" value="hearing"> Hearing</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Amount</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 100%;">
          <span data-field="line_items[{{ i-1 }}].amount">{{ line_items[i-1].amount }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Need help?</p>
    <p>Call us at <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">Please continue to the form on the next page.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Part 3: Attach your receipts or Explanation of Benefit forms</h2>
  </header>

  <div class="info-box">
    <p>Now it's time to attach the papers that confirm the expenses. These can include receipts from health care providers or an Explanation of Benefit (EOB) forms from your insurance plan.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box" style="border-color: red;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&#9888; Provide an itemized receipt or EOB for each amount requested, or your request will be denied.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&#9888; Please don't send credit card receipts, cashed checks or copies of checks. They are not acceptable receipts for reimbursement.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">The papers you provide as proof for your expenses <span data-field="proof_requirement">{{ proof_requirement }}</span> show specific information:</p>
    <div class="grid-2-col">
      <div>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">For medical expenses:</p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_1">{{ receipt_detail_1 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_2">{{ receipt_detail_2 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_3">{{ receipt_detail_3 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_4">{{ receipt_detail_4 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_5">{{ receipt_detail_5 }}</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">For prescriptions:</p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_6">{{ receipt_detail_6 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_7">{{ receipt_detail_7 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_8">{{ receipt_detail_8 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_9">{{ receipt_detail_9 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_10">{{ receipt_detail_10 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="receipt_detail_11">{{ receipt_detail_11 }}</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">1. Please do not write any information on the receipt.</p>
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">2. Use only blue or black ink. Don't use a highlighter.</p>
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">3. Tape small receipts to a sheet of 8.5 x 11 blank white paper.</p>
  </div>

  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Part 4: Certify and sign</h2>
  </header>

  <div class="info-box">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003; Please reimburse me for the expenses I am submitting on this form.</p>
    <p>By signing below I certify (promise) that:</p>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li><span data-field="certification_1">{{ certification_1 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="certification_2">{{ certification_2 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="certification_3">{{ certification_3 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="certification_4">{{ certification_4 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="certification_5">{{ certification_5 }}</span></li>
    </ul>
    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <p>Sign here</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 300px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span data-field="signature_line">{{ signature_line }}</span>
      </div>
      <p>Date</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 150px;">
        <span data-field="date_signed">{{ date_signed }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div class="info-box" style="border-color: #007bff;">
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">&#9993; Mail or fax pages 2 and 3 of this form along with your receipts</p>
        <p>Mail to: <span data-field="mailing_address_2">{{ mailing_address_2 }}</span></p>
        <p>P.O. Box <span data-field="zip_code_2">{{ zip_code_2 }}</span> Atlanta, GA <span data-field="zip_code_3">{{ zip_code_3 }}</span></p>
        <p>Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span> | Toll-free fax: <span data-field="toll_free_fax">{{ toll_free_fax }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div class="info-box" style="border-color: #dc3545;">
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">Copy your form and receipts for your records before mailing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
    <div>
      <p>Need help?</p>
      <p>Call us at <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      Page 3 of 3
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>